## 8. Point 15 — no new motion
`git diff master -- web/static/css/styles.css` adds exactly one line:
`[data-ins-tab]:focus-visible,` appended to the existing focus-outline selector list
(styles.css:225) — no new `transition`/`animation`/`@keyframes`. The new tab buttons'
class list (`px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium border-b-2 border-transparent text-gray-600
dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 dark:hover:text-gray-100`) carries no
`transition-*` utility, so the active/inactive swap is an instant attribute/class change,
not an animation — no `prefers-reduced-motion` concern is introduced.

